5 Proof of Concept Experiments\line We report the results from a preliminary set of experiments2. In each case, the MaxEnt agent learns to access\line the set of reachable states within a small number of iterations, while monotonically increasing the entropy of\line the induced state distribution.}
\par \pard\plain \s21\loch\sb0\sa283\ql\sb0\sa283\ltrpar{\loch
Recall that Algorithm 1 requires access to an approximate planning oracle and a density estimator\line for the induced distribution. Here the density estimator is deliberately chosen to be simple \u8211\'96 a count-\line based estimate over the discretized state space. It is possible to use neural density estimators and other\line function-approximation based estimators in its stead.}
